{
  "_comment": [
    "Live2D expression and motion presets for the 28 SillyTavern emotions, on Live2D Cubism's standard parameters.",
    "expressions: parameter -> value. Eye openness multiplies the current value (1 keeps it); everything else is added.",
    "Eyebrow angle: -1 angry (inner ends down), +1 worried (inner ends up). Mouth form: -1 frown, +1 smile.",
    "The mouth never moves on its own: the characters react to the chat, they don't talk. Only surprise and",
    "realization part the lips a little, as a held shape.",
    "motions: a short calm reaction played with the expression (keyframes [seconds, value] per parameter).",
    "idle: the looping breathing motion played whenever nothing else is."
  ],
